# Supabase

Two projects (dev + prod). Apply the **same** files in `supabase/migrations/` to both. Human docs: `supabase/README.md`.

- Use the Supabase MCP for dashboard/schema work when available; never put service-role keys in the app.
- Flutter uses the anon/publishable key only. Sync is gated on verified (non-anonymous) auth — `.cursor/references/offline-sync.md`.
- New tables/columns: SQL migration + remote DTO + mapper + repository pull/enqueue path.
- Guests stay local until email OTP or Google. Do not enable anonymous auth for the verified-sync path.
- Flavor JSON is gitignored — `.cursor/references/secrets.md`.
